    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Felt warm last night; no chills or rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lower right tooth pain and gum swelling; no trouble swallowing, no voice change, no sore throat</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Worried that the pain would trigger cravings; no opioid or alcohol use; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

