 up to five days</td><td>Oral route</td><td>1948-09-21 to 1948-09-26</td><td>completed</td><td>S</td></tr><tr ID="medication-8"><td>Acetaminophen 500 mg oral tablet, two tablets by mouth every 8 hours as needed for tooth pain, no more than 3,000 mg a day, for up to five days</td><td>Two tablets by mouth every 8 hours as needed, up to 3,000 mg a day</td><td>Oral route</td><td>1948-09-21 to 1948-09-26</td><td>completed</td><td>S</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

